	"data": "Star\n\nGPU Offloading (2026-05-08): VRAM usage reduced from ~2.7GB to ~0.8GB after migrating Project Hearth services to Mac Mini.\n\nRemaining Hearth Service:\nWhisper STT (port 10300, Wyoming protocol): ~800MB VRAM, small model\nPlanned decommissioning pending Groq cloud STT cutover\n\nGPU Now Available For:\nOllama LLM inference\nRAG pipelines\nFuture CUDA projects\n\nNote: Variable GPU workload was causing latency spikes for voice assistant; migration to dedicated Mac Mini + cloud resolves this.\n\nCron…",
